																			"name": "collaborate2Model",
																			"documentation": "This is the method that creates the model nodes that are going to compose the source of data for the page body content list. This\nbeing the application dashboard page we should add (but on different versions) the next list of items:\n- The Application Version Box.\n- The list of NeoCom notifications and change reports.\n- The list of pending to read Eve Online notifications.\n- The list of registered Credentials.\nOn this first version we should just add the Version Box and the list of Credentials to be able to create or select a Pilot.",
																			"visibility": "public",
																			"isStatic": false,
																			"isLeaf": false,
																			"parameters": [
																				{
																					"_type": "UMLParameter",
